               <code>
                  <coding>
                     <system value="http://loinc.org"/>
                     <code value="8648-8"/>
                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital stay of your 59-year-old male patient, admitted on 07/04/2026 due to an acute exacerbation of his known chronic obstructive pulmonary disease. On admission, the patient presented with increased dyspnea, productive cough, and reduced oxygen saturation. Physical examination, chest X-ray, arterial blood gas analysis, and pulse oximetry confirmed an acute exacerbation. Spirometry supported the diagnosis of severe airflow obstruction. The patient was treated with inhaled bronchodilators via nebulizer, systemic corticosteroids, and supplemental oxygen therapy. Vital signs were monitored closely throughout the stay. The patient responded well to treatment, with significant improvement in respiratory function and oxygenation. He was discharged on 08/04/2026 in stable condition. Please continue maintenance bronchodilator therapy and ensure close outpatient follow-up. Smoking cessation counseling was provided prior to discharge. Yours sincerely, Dr. [Treating Physician]</div>
               </text>
